1
00:00:00,295 --> 00:00:03,135
(Howard:)That would be cool.
I'd go to that reception.

2
00:00:03,590 --> 00:00:06,470
(Penny:)Come on, this is huge.
Raj is gonna be in People magazine...

3
00:00:06,635 --> 00:00:09,975
(Penny:)...and he didn't even have to knock up
one of the Spears sisters.

4
00:00:10,889 --> 00:00:12,929
(Raj:)Would you like to go with me?

5
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:15,180
Of course I would. I would be honored.

6
00:00:15,352 --> 00:00:16,732
(Raj:)Really? Cool.

7
00:00:16,895 --> 00:00:19,065
(Penny:)Shame on you guys.

8
00:00:21,817 --> 00:00:24,777
(Raj:)Look at that, I got a date with Penny.

9
00:00:25,237 --> 00:00:27,237
(Raj:)I can't believe it took you a whole year.

10
00:00:29,241 --> 00:00:30,821
- Now?
- Now.

11
00:00:36,289 --> 00:00:39,459
(Raj:)Hey, buddy.
I'm gonna be in People magazine.

12
00:00:39,626 --> 00:00:42,296
(Charlie Sheen(turning round):)Yeah, call me when you're on the cover.

13
00:00:53,640 --> 00:00:55,430
(Penny:)Oh, Raj, look at you.

14
00:00:55,600 --> 00:01:01,020
I know. I'm resplendent
like the noonday sun, am I not?

